    <briefdescription>
<para>BGAPI response structure for generic error responses. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure is used to communicate a generic error response for a BGAPI command when a command-specific response cannot be used. For example, if an unknown command is received, the response will use this generic error response structure. Every BGAPI command that returns has the result code as the first field of the response. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
